/data/
/inbox/
/imports/
/statements/
/archive/
/backups/

# Deliberately synthetic fixtures stay committable. See docs/decisions.md D-019.
!tests/fixtures/synthetic/**/*.csv
!tests/fixtures/synthetic/**/*.pdf
